{"id":"82cd211c4765302c","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Haar Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure — ZFC Measure8 Haar Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure — ZFC Measure8 Haar Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-haar-measure — ZFC Measure8 Haar Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d11f892f3efc814\" href=\"?note=1d11f892f3efc814\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"69f8a4b0afb36176\" href=\"?note=69f8a4b0afb36176\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-hausdorff-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"682d2801cf83c784\" href=\"?note=682d2801cf83c784\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-top5-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"67cf48a2f6e27861\" href=\"?note=67cf48a2f6e27861\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset\">58-df-zfc-top2-compact-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\mu,X,m,e,i,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\times\\in V\">\\(G,\\mu,X,m,e,i,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\times\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (imported local-compactness and separation predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (imported continuity and compact-subset predicates)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\)</span> is the imported Borel sigma-algebra</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (typed functions and product topology)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RadonLF}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{RadonLF}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is the locally finite regular Borel-measure predicate defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}radon\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RadonLF}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\to\nK\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\land\\mu(K)&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mu(A)=\\sup\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land K\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{95pt}{}\\land\n\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}radon\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RadonLF}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\to\nK\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\land\\mu(K)&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mu(A)=\\sup\\{\\mu(K):K\\subseteq A\\land K\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2CompactSubset}_S(K,X,\\tau)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{95pt}{}\\land\n\\mu(A)=\\inf\\{\\mu(U):A\\subseteq U\\land U\\in\\tau\\}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}haar\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,m,e,i,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;G=\\langle X,m,e,i,\\tau\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(X,m)\n\\land e\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\n\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X\\})\n\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau\\})\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\tau_\\times=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X\\times X,\\tau_\\times,X,\\tau,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,X,\\tau,i)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RadonLF}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\land\\mu(X)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall g\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu(\\{m(\\langle g,a\\rangle):a\\in A\\})=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}haar\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8HaarMeasure}_S(\\mu,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X,m,e,i,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;G=\\langle X,m,e,i,\\tau\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(X,m)\n\\land e\\in X\\land\\mathrm{Function}(i,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\bigl(m(\\langle x,i(x)\\rangle)=e\n\\land m(\\langle i(x),x\\rangle)=e\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2LocallyCompactSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5HausdorffSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X\\})\n\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=X\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau\\})\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\tau_\\times=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X\\times X,\\tau_\\times,X,\\tau,m)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ContinuousMap}_S(X,\\tau,X,\\tau,i)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{RadonLF}_S(\\mu,X,\\tau)\\land\\mu(X)&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall g\\in X\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mu(\\{m(\\langle g,a\\rangle):a\\in A\\})=\\mu(A)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiplication continuity now uses the registered product-topology predicate with explicit two-coordinate carrier and topology families; group multiplication is applied to ordered pairs, as required by the upstream function convention.</li>\n<li>Compact sets are explicitly required to be Borel before <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(K)\">\\(\\mu(K)\\)</span> is evaluated, and Radon local finiteness and inner/outer regularity remain stated in full.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-top2-locally-compact-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d11f892f3efc814","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer